---
title: Andrii Bychkovskyi - Game Developer
description: "The homepage of Andrii Bychkovskyi: games, articles, and contact information"
layout: default
---
<style>
  #title {
    @media not (prefers-reduced-motion) {
      transition: opacity 0.4s;

      @starting-style {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }

  #bio {
    @media not (prefers-reduced-motion) {
      transition: opacity 0.3s;

      @starting-style {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }

  #icons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 2em 0 2em;
    gap: 1em;
  }

  #icons > a {
    @media not (prefers-reduced-motion) {
      animation: bounce-appear;
    }
  }

  #source {
    @media not (prefers-reduced-motion) {
      transition: opacity 1s;

      @starting-style {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }
</style>

<img alt="" src="/images/fox.webp" width="177" height="152" />
<h2 id="title" class="selectable">Andrii Bychkovskyi</h2>
<p id="bio" class="selectable">  
  A full-time indie game developer, I explore different genres to craft something unique.<br>
  I also do <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@icyUA">podcasts</a> in Ukrainian about gamedev and used to play in a <a href="https://yastanukrasce.bandcamp.com/music">band</a>.
</p>

<div id="icons">
  {% for link in links %}
    <a
      class="dim"
      href="{{ link.url }}"
      title="{{ link.name }}"
      style="
        animation-duration: {{ forloop.index0 | times: 0.1 | plus: 0.5 }}s;
        --accent-bright: #{{ link.color }};
      "
    >
      {% include 'icons/{{ link.name }}.svg' %}
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div id="source">
  <a class="dim" href="https://github.com/bxaxvx/personal-website">Website Source</a>
</div>
